# Vantera

White-label multi-tenant business operations platform.

## Stack

- **Monorepo:** Turborepo + pnpm workspaces
- **App:** Next.js 14 (App Router) — `apps/web` (admin + portal + auth in one app)
- **Database:** Drizzle ORM — schema lives in `packages/db` (shared source of truth)
- **Auth / backend:** Supabase (`@supabase/ssr`, `@supabase/supabase-js`)
- **UI:** Tailwind CSS 3.4; shadcn components go in `apps/web/components/ui` (install in a separate step)
- **Forms:** react-hook-form + zod + `@hookform/resolvers`
- **State / data:** zustand, TanStack Query, TanStack Table
- **API / jobs:** Hono, Trigger.dev, Resend, Twilio, Stripe

## Structure

- `apps/web/app/(admin)` — admin route group
- `apps/web/app/(portal)` — client portal route group
- `apps/web/app/(auth)` — auth routes
- `apps/web/app/api` — API routes and webhooks
- `packages/db` — Drizzle schema and migrations
- `packages/types` — shared TypeScript types
- `packages/utils` — shared utilities

## Conventions

- Package manager: **pnpm only**
- TypeScript **strict** everywhere; `apps/web` extends root `tsconfig.json`
- Do not duplicate Drizzle schema in the app — import from `@vantera/db`
- Multi-tenant and branding logic belong in middleware / `lib/branding`, not scattered in pages
- Prefer workspace packages (`@vantera/*`) over duplicating code in `apps/web`

## Commands

```bash
pnpm dev          # turbo dev (all packages)
pnpm build        # turbo build
pnpm lint         # turbo lint
pnpm type-check   # turbo type-check
```
